    "description": "Puget Energy, Inc. is a Bellevue, Washington-based utility holding company whose core business is Puget Sound Energy, the regulated electric and natural gas utility serving western Washington. PSE is wholly owned by Puget Energy and serves approximately 1.26 million electric customers and 883,000 natural-gas customers across roughly 6,000 square miles in 10 counties. Puget LNG is a separate nonregulated subsidiary of Puget Energy. The platform is owned through Puget Holdings by BCI (20.9%), Macquarie Asset Management (15.8%), OMERS (23.9%), Ontario Teachers' Pension Plan (15.8%), AIMCo (13.6%) and PGGM (10.0%). No later sponsor transfer or signed pending platform sale was identified through August 23, 2026. Puget Sound Energy is retained as the regulated subsidiary and operating brand rather than counted as a separate PortCo.",
